  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "A real code boundary",
      "items": [
        "proxyclient imports proxywire and service, but never ddm",
        "So when DM_DDM_URL is set the mdm role can only reach the engine over the hop; unset, it calls inproc in-process"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The hop",
      "items": [
        "The raw check-in body is POSTed unchanged, with its own Content-Type",
        "X-MDM-Signature carries base64(HMAC-SHA256(key, body)), both directions",
        "Separate send and receive keys; mTLS and bearer auth are optional extras"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Relayed faithfully",
      "items": [
        "200 returns the body, 404 stays 404, 400 becomes a bad-request error",
        "Anything else becomes an internal error rather than leaking a status",
        "Wrong keys and oversized bodies are rejected at the boundary"
      ]
    }
  ]
